            <note corresp="#d287-f3" n="3" xml:id="d287-f3-content">
                <p>Regarding Minister Chapin’s recall, see the memorandum of conversation of
                    February 10, by Rusk, <ref target="#pg463">p. 463</ref>.</p>
            </note>
